<p align="center">
  <img src="docs/assets/hero-studio.png" alt="Hermes Mobile on a modern Android flagship phone resting on warm walnut wood and pale travertine stone" width="100%">
</p>

**{{ project }}** is a fast, native Android client (API 28–36, Java, zero WebView, ~1.9 MiB signed release APK) for chatting, coding, approving actions, running parallel tasks, and customizing your workspace with your own Hermes Agent. The app automatically follows your Android system language (**English** and **French**) with a 1-tap override and syncs your preference to Hermes.

**[Explore the Showcase & Docs Portal →]({{ pages_url }}en/)** · [Documentation]({{ pages_url }}en/docs/) · [Live Device Gallery]({{ pages_url }}en/walkthrough/) · [Latest Signed APK](https://github.com/{{ repository }}/releases/latest)

> **Companion server requirement:** {{ project }} requires our Hermes Agent fork at **[{{ fork_repository }}]({{ fork_url }})**. It relies on the fork’s single-host multi-profile routing (`/p/{profile}`), per-session concurrent run execution, run-scoped instructions, Live UI modding (`ui.patch`), universal push deliveries (`mobile_deliver`), Brain Studio (memory, Smart Notes, pattern-gated habits, universal sharing, FTS5 search, skill studio, workspace files), visual approval diffs, and the approved device bridge.

